Class Use with <code>FormworkForm</code> any data <code>FormworkModelForm</code> a model; subscript it for typed <code>instance</code> and <code>save()</code>: <code>FormworkModelForm[Book]</code> <p>Both render with <code>FormworkRenderer</code> and use <code>FormworkBoundField</code>. It adds <code>aria-required</code> to a mandatory field, and <code>aria-labelledby</code> to a dropdown trigger that <code>&lt;label for&gt;</code> cannot target.</p> <p>For icons, descriptions or a trigger class on model choices, return a <code>ChoiceLabel</code> from <code>label_from_instance</code>:</p> <pre><code>from django import forms

from django_formwork import ChoiceLabel


class MemberChoiceField(forms.ModelChoiceField):
    def label_from_instance(self, obj):
        return ChoiceLabel(obj.name, description=obj.email)
